---
// src/components/TechStack.astro
---

<section class="tech-section" id="architecture">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="badge badge-brand">System Architecture</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Built with Pure Rust & Modern Native Primitives</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Eliminating web engine overhead to deliver immediate response times and maximum network throughput.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Tech Stack Matrix -->
    <div class="tech-matrix grid-hairline">
      <div class="tech-card">
        <div class="tech-card-header">
          <span class="tech-role font-mono">CORE LANGUAGE</span>
          <span class="badge badge-brand">Rust 1.80+</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="tech-name">Memory Safety without Garbage Collection</h4>
        <p class="tech-desc">
          Guarantees zero data races across multi-threaded socket streams and disk writers. Compile-time borrow checking ensures zero use-after-free or buffer overflow vulnerabilities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-card">
        <div class="tech-card-header">
          <span class="tech-role font-mono">GUI TOOLKIT</span>
          <span class="badge badge-brand">Slint Declarative UI</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="tech-name">Native Desktop Graphics Pipeline</h4>
        <p class="tech-desc">
          Compiled directly into native C++/Rust machine code. Operates with sub-millisecond input latency, minimal CPU overhead during heavy 100MB/s transfers, and seamless dark/light styling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-card">
        <div class="tech-card-header">
          <span class="tech-role font-mono">ASYNC RUNTIME</span>
          <span class="badge badge-brand">Tokio Multi-Thread</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="tech-name">Non-Blocking Work-Stealing Reactor</h4>
        <p class="tech-desc">
          Handles hundreds of concurrent HTTP chunk streams and asynchronous disk write operations without starving UI render threads or blocking user interactions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-card">
        <div class="tech-card-header">
          <span class="tech-role font-mono">LOCAL DATABASE</span>
          <span class="badge badge-brand">SQLite + SQLx</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="tech-name">ACID Task State Journaling</h4>
        <p class="tech-desc">
          Compile-time SQL query validation and robust write-ahead logging (WAL). Preserves segment states even across sudden power cuts or OS reboot cycles.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Table: SpeedFlow vs Electron -->
    <div class="comparison-pane pane">
      <div class="comparison-header">
        <h3 class="comparison-title">Why Native Rust Matters: Benchmark Overview</h3>
        <span class="font-mono text-tertiary" style="font-size: 11px;">Desktop Download Manager Comparison</span>
      </div>

      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="benchmark-table font-mono">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Metric</th>
              <th class="col-highlight">SpeedFlow (Rust + Slint)</th>
              <th>Typical Electron App</th>
              <th>Impact</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="col-name">Idle Memory Usage</td>
              <td class="col-highlight text-brand font-bold">~ 28 MB RAM</td>
              <td class="text-secondary">250 MB - 450 MB RAM</td>
              <td>10x Less Memory Consumption</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="col-name">Application Cold Startup</td>
              <td class="col-highlight text-brand font-bold">&lt; 150 ms</td>
              <td class="text-secondary">2,200 ms - 4,000 ms</td>
              <td>Instant launch on system boot</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="col-name">Bundle Executable Size</td>
              <td class="col-highlight text-brand font-bold">~ 18 MB</td>
              <td class="text-secondary">120 MB - 180 MB</td>
              <td>Lightweight portable download</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="col-name">Telemetry & Tracking</td>
              <td class="col-highlight text-brand font-bold">0% (Zero Telemetry)</td>
              <td class="text-secondary">Analytics & Crashlytics</td>
              <td>Complete user privacy guarantee</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tech-section {
    padding: 64px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background-color: var(--surface-secondary);
  }

  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 12px;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3.2vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .tech-matrix {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .tech-card {
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    background-color: var(--surface);
  }

  .tech-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .tech-role {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .tech-name {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .tech-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Benchmark Table */
  .comparison-pane {
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .comparison-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background-color: var(--surface-secondary);
  }

  .comparison-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .benchmark-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .benchmark-table th,
  .benchmark-table td {
    padding: 12px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .benchmark-table thead tr {
    background-color: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .benchmark-table tbody tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .col-highlight {
    background-color: var(--brand-subtle);
  }

  .col-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .font-bold {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .text-brand {
    color: var(--brand-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .tech-matrix {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
